WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.740 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:46.750 --> 01:51.090
Geez, this is heavy! Fin, help me.

01:51.090 --> 01:55.090
No way, Angels don't do manual labor.

01:55.090 --> 01:58.470
Fine! Meanie!

02:02.390 --> 02:05.640
What are you doing?! Stop it!

02:06.480 --> 02:09.650
What are you doing?! You guys stop that!

02:09.650 --> 02:10.980
Oh, no!

02:10.980 --> 02:12.610
Somebody help me!

02:12.610 --> 02:14.320
Stay still!

02:14.320 --> 02:15.400
Quit it!

02:22.030 --> 02:24.330
Obaa-chan, hurry!

02:28.750 --> 02:35.420
My Partner Is a Mysterious Old Lady?

02:40.590 --> 02:43.600
We're safe now. No one followed us.

02:43.600 --> 02:45.640
Obaa-chan, are you okay?

02:45.640 --> 02:48.810
How can I be okay after making me run all this way?

02:50.140 --> 02:53.820
Making you run?! For whose sake do you think we were running?!

02:53.820 --> 02:57.230
My feet hurt.

02:57.230 --> 03:00.950
Uh... Hey! Wait a minute...

03:08.620 --> 03:10.500
It's impolite even though she can't see you.

03:10.500 --> 03:11.330
But...

03:11.330 --> 03:16.050
Um... Let's call your house and have someone pick you up.

03:16.050 --> 03:20.220
I don't carry a phone in my purse.

03:20.220 --> 03:21.470
Huh?

03:21.470 --> 03:24.140
I don't have a home.

03:24.140 --> 03:26.470
You're all alone...?

03:27.220 --> 03:31.940
I'm sorry... I'm Kusakabe Maron. And you are?

03:31.940 --> 03:33.650
My name?

03:35.690 --> 03:37.400
Oozora...

03:37.400 --> 03:40.150
Yeah, Oozora Kaori.

03:40.150 --> 03:43.410
Oozora Kaori? Like the race horse?

03:43.410 --> 03:47.790
Maron, right? I wouldn't be laughing with a name like that.

03:47.790 --> 03:48.700
What?!

03:48.700 --> 03:54.080
What are you doing?! Don't you serve tea to your guests in this house?

03:54.080 --> 03:56.000
You're not a guest!

03:56.000 --> 03:58.130
I see... I understand...

03:58.130 --> 04:04.010
You don't care what happens to this old hag. Fine, I'll leave.

04:05.550 --> 04:07.680
All right, I'll get tea.

04:07.680 --> 04:11.060
Wait! Cake would be good, too.

04:11.060 --> 04:12.390
Don't have any.

04:13.100 --> 04:17.190
This girl... I can use her.

04:23.150 --> 04:27.370
Maron! That old lady is weird. Are you listening?!

04:27.370 --> 04:30.160
Really! She's not <i>just</i> weird!

04:30.160 --> 04:32.910
No! I mean that she's planning something!

04:32.910 --> 04:36.290
You're right. After tea, it's dinner!

04:36.290 --> 04:41.460
I mean...! Dinner?! You're making dinner for her, too?!

04:41.460 --> 04:44.720
Well, yeah... She said she doesn't even have a home.

04:44.720 --> 04:47.090
Ouch!!

04:47.090 --> 04:48.260
What is it this time?

04:48.260 --> 04:49.640
Maron!

04:50.970 --> 04:56.100
Being at the park all day made me chilly...

04:56.100 --> 04:58.690
So prepare me a hot bath.

04:58.690 --> 05:00.020
A bath?!

05:00.020 --> 05:04.820
Warm water heals. Don't you know? Ouch!

05:06.490 --> 05:08.070
All right, all right...

05:09.620 --> 05:12.290
<i>I'm going to strip away that false face!</i>

05:17.750 --> 05:19.710
<i>She *does* have a phone!</i>

05:19.710 --> 05:22.710
Hello. Good work, guys.

05:22.710 --> 05:24.340
I'll pay you guys later.

05:24.340 --> 05:29.640
<i>Money? She's planning something. I have to tell Maron!</i>

05:35.890 --> 05:37.060
Delicious.

05:44.530 --> 05:47.530
Miyako! What a slob!

05:47.530 --> 05:50.200
Use a table!

05:50.200 --> 05:52.240
Since when was that a law?

05:52.240 --> 05:57.460
Go invite Maron-chan. We're having stew for dinner tonight.

05:57.460 --> 05:58.960
Stew, huh...

05:58.960 --> 06:01.460
Your stew is the best!

06:01.460 --> 06:04.920
Fin! Fin! Geez, where did she go?

06:04.920 --> 06:07.420
I'm going shopping.

06:14.890 --> 06:16.520
Huh? You're going out?

06:16.520 --> 06:18.600
Just a little shopping... What is it?

06:18.600 --> 06:19.480
Um...

06:21.400 --> 06:23.940
Oh, I forgot the towel.

06:23.940 --> 06:25.360
She's going to nag again.

06:25.360 --> 06:27.110
Bath towel?

06:30.320 --> 06:31.990
<i>No way!</i>

06:31.990 --> 06:35.830
Just because you're living alone doesn't mean...!

06:47.590 --> 06:51.510
Huh? Where's Miyako? I wonder what she wanted?

06:59.310 --> 07:01.980
Ohhhh, I'm thirsty.

07:03.230 --> 07:07.440
Geez. Not even a single beer.

07:08.570 --> 07:11.320
What kind of a house is this?

07:11.320 --> 07:14.080
Oh no! My face is drying up.

07:14.080 --> 07:17.700
Okay... Where's the make-up?

07:19.080 --> 07:26.500
Let me out of here! Maron! Maron!

07:31.840 --> 07:32.800
Been shopping?

07:32.800 --> 07:33.890
That's right.

07:35.430 --> 07:37.640
Huh? Beer and wine?

07:37.640 --> 07:40.480
Wow. You drink alcohol?

07:40.480 --> 07:44.150
What are you talking about? <i>I'm</i> not going to drink it.

07:44.150 --> 07:46.230
A guest? Who?

07:46.230 --> 07:47.610
It can be whoever I want.

07:47.610 --> 07:50.530
Seeing that you're being evasive... Could it be a man?

07:50.530 --> 07:52.320
What if it is?

07:53.860 --> 07:56.280
Really? You're not kidding?

08:04.210 --> 08:07.630
What is she doing? Hey, Miyako!

08:08.500 --> 08:10.590
It's just Chiaki...

08:11.550 --> 08:17.510
Listen. Maron has a guest and it seems to be a man.

08:17.510 --> 08:19.850
We have to check!

08:21.850 --> 08:22.940
Maron?

08:22.940 --> 08:28.480
No... Not <i>there!</i>

08:28.480 --> 08:33.280
Stop it...! Please...! No more!

08:33.280 --> 08:36.070
Could it be... uninhibited sex?!

08:36.070 --> 08:39.160
Child molestation!

08:39.160 --> 08:39.950
Maron!

08:45.040 --> 08:46.290
Maron!

08:46.290 --> 08:48.790
- Don't be stingy!

08:46.790 --> 08:48.790
- I said NO!

08:55.680 --> 08:58.510
What are you guys doing here?!

09:05.100 --> 09:09.020
I never thought that Maron would do such a thing, anyway!

09:09.900 --> 09:11.440
What thing?

09:11.440 --> 09:12.990
What is it, Miyako?

09:12.990 --> 09:15.400
I... I wonder what?

09:15.400 --> 09:18.490
Anyway, what are you going to do with that old lady?

09:18.490 --> 09:23.040
Well... She says she has nowhere to go...

09:23.660 --> 09:27.710
She's a nag, but the least I can do is to let her stay for a while.

09:28.250 --> 09:32.960
But, Maron... Just because you're living on your own...

09:32.960 --> 09:34.170
Huh?

09:34.170 --> 09:39.090
Living with a complete stranger...

09:39.090 --> 09:43.520
And if she becomes sick, what are you going to do?

09:44.060 --> 09:46.890
She's all alone, too...

09:52.440 --> 09:54.860
We should call the police.

09:54.860 --> 09:59.110
Maybe someone is looking for her.

09:59.110 --> 10:01.450
Well, I suppose so. You're right.

10:01.450 --> 10:04.500
I'll call my dad.

10:05.540 --> 10:06.500
What was that?

10:10.330 --> 10:12.500
Oh, no! She's gone!

10:12.500 --> 10:13.420
What?!

10:21.890 --> 10:25.520
Morning! I'm finally out.

10:25.520 --> 10:27.310
Where's Maron?

10:28.350 --> 10:30.980
Notice

10:28.350 --> 10:30.980
Don't go away!

10:28.350 --> 10:30.980
I'll return right after these messages!

10:28.350 --> 10:30.980
Kaitou Jeanne

10:31.900 --> 10:34.530
Notice

10:31.900 --> 10:34.530
I'm back to continue my adventures

10:31.900 --> 10:34.530
Kaitou Jeanne

10:43.620 --> 10:45.080
Obaa-chan!

10:49.210 --> 10:51.830
Why'd you leave so suddenly?

10:52.790 --> 10:56.880
I didn't want to cause you trouble.

10:56.880 --> 11:00.970
Trouble? You've already caused enough.

11:00.970 --> 11:04.510
Well, excuse me! Now, leave me alone!

11:06.430 --> 11:09.600
I'll have to go find somebody else.

11:09.600 --> 11:11.060
Somebody else?

11:11.480 --> 11:12.860
A partner.

11:12.860 --> 11:14.360
Partner?

11:14.360 --> 11:20.530
I've been waiting here, hoping to find someone worthy to work with.

11:20.530 --> 11:21.820
Work?

11:21.820 --> 11:24.410
What? I'm not worthy?

11:24.410 --> 11:25.490
Exactly.

11:25.490 --> 11:27.290
Why?

11:27.290 --> 11:29.540
You're all alone.

11:30.620 --> 11:34.380
If something happens, you have no one to help you.

11:34.380 --> 11:37.460
Same goes for you.

11:39.420 --> 11:42.220
Are you worried about me?

11:42.220 --> 11:44.260
What kind of work is it?

11:44.260 --> 11:47.180
Be quiet. Go away.

11:47.180 --> 11:50.930
No way. I'm not moving until you tell me.

11:50.930 --> 11:54.060
I'm worried about you, too.

11:59.320 --> 12:01.450
We're both lonely.

12:02.360 --> 12:04.410
It could be dangerous...

12:04.410 --> 12:06.580
I'm fine!

12:06.580 --> 12:09.410
I've been training in gymnastics.

12:09.410 --> 12:11.250
Lend me your ear.

12:13.250 --> 12:15.210
What?! Thief?!

12:15.210 --> 12:16.840
Shh! You're too loud.

12:16.840 --> 12:20.840
I can't. I hate robbery the most!

12:20.840 --> 12:23.300
That's why I told you that I wouldn't ask.

12:23.300 --> 12:24.840
Well...!

12:24.840 --> 12:26.260
But why?

12:27.220 --> 12:32.430
I said robbery, but the artifact was originally mine.

12:32.520 --> 12:36.690
You know that store called Aoki Jewelry, on the main street?

12:40.780 --> 12:44.530
That's where my brooch is.

12:51.200 --> 12:57.580
My only son gave it to me as a present before he died. It's a memento.

12:59.630 --> 13:04.010
But I was deceived by a bad man, and he took it away from me.

13:07.180 --> 13:09.220
Found it!

13:10.760 --> 13:12.890
A memento of your son...?

13:12.890 --> 13:15.100
I just want to borrow it for one night.

13:15.100 --> 13:19.860
I want to visit his grave on the day he died, with that brooch on...

13:20.520 --> 13:23.400
Actually, just forget about it.

13:23.400 --> 13:26.070
I can't ask you to do this.

13:28.240 --> 13:30.450
All right. I'll do it.

13:30.450 --> 13:34.540
But, return the brooch to the store when you're done.

13:34.540 --> 13:36.460
Of course.

13:36.460 --> 13:38.750
So, when did he die?

13:38.750 --> 13:40.500
- Today.

13:40.500 --> 13:43.590
Don't worry. My plan is already complete.

13:52.060 --> 13:53.890
Hello! It's Fin!

13:53.890 --> 13:56.140
Fin! Where have you been?!

13:56.140 --> 13:59.020
Where?! I've been...! I've been...!

13:59.020 --> 14:02.820
This isn't the time! It's time to work! I found a Demon!

14:02.820 --> 14:05.190
I can't. I'm busy today.

14:05.190 --> 14:08.200
No! This can't wait!

14:08.200 --> 14:12.790
The brooch that's possessed by a Demon is on display.

14:12.790 --> 14:14.330
Did you say "brooch?!"

14:14.330 --> 14:16.370
At Aoki Jewelry on the main street.

14:16.370 --> 14:19.170
No way! And the notice card?

14:19.170 --> 14:21.380
I've already sent it.

14:21.380 --> 14:24.050
Oh no! She already left!

14:24.050 --> 14:26.090
Whoa! Wait, Maron!

14:38.850 --> 14:41.310
Miyako is here.

14:44.360 --> 14:46.070
The 8 o'clock bell.

14:47.400 --> 14:50.070
Thirty minutes until the start of the mission.

14:50.070 --> 14:53.580
What? The notice card said 9:00 P.M.

14:53.580 --> 14:56.450
Don't worry. Fin, please.

14:56.450 --> 14:57.870
Okay.

15:16.970 --> 15:18.180
She's here!

15:18.180 --> 15:20.640
What? There's still another hour left.

15:20.640 --> 15:22.100
She's on the roof!

15:22.100 --> 15:24.520
She's planning to trick us!

15:24.520 --> 15:28.570
Harukawa and Natsuda, go to the roof. Akita and Fuyuta, stay here.

15:28.570 --> 15:29.610
Yes, sir!

15:29.610 --> 15:34.320
That's odd. Jeanne's changing her time on the notice?

15:37.740 --> 15:39.960
Obaa-chan, are you all right?

15:39.960 --> 15:40.830
Maron...

15:40.830 --> 15:44.080
We have to change plans. The cops are everywhere.

15:44.080 --> 15:47.210
Escape through the emergency exit. I'll get the brooch.

15:47.210 --> 15:48.840
But...

15:48.840 --> 15:51.090
Hurry! I'll be the decoy.

15:51.090 --> 15:54.430
Okay. Be careful!

15:58.470 --> 16:00.100
There she is! Over there!

16:02.440 --> 16:04.100
Hey! Are you all right?

16:09.440 --> 16:10.740
Sinbad...

16:12.740 --> 16:14.700
He's in the building!

16:14.700 --> 16:16.370
<i>You idiots! Catch him!</i>

16:16.370 --> 16:18.040
Y-Yes, sir!

16:18.410 --> 16:20.750
Man! He's interfering again!

16:20.750 --> 16:22.410
In that case...!

16:27.000 --> 16:30.260
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power for Obaa-chan.</i>

16:40.720 --> 16:42.680
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

16:42.680 --> 16:44.600
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

16:44.600 --> 16:46.310
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

16:49.900 --> 16:54.240
My God! You allowed her to enter so easily!

16:54.240 --> 16:57.070
How can you protect my brooch like this?!

16:57.070 --> 16:59.780
Calm down! Everything is fine!

16:59.780 --> 17:01.080
W-What happened?!

17:01.080 --> 17:02.700
Looks like she cut the power.

17:03.540 --> 17:05.670
Don't worry. Turn on the lights.

17:09.710 --> 17:12.170
I'm not falling for the same trick again, Jeanne.

17:17.140 --> 17:18.300
Over there!

17:18.300 --> 17:19.470
Yes, ma'am!

17:23.600 --> 17:26.520
Catching me is impossible!

17:38.370 --> 17:40.660
They're all empty!

17:41.160 --> 17:46.620
Arrgghh! What the...? I set up this trap and everything, and it's not even Jeanne!

17:56.220 --> 17:57.050
Jeanne!

18:03.350 --> 18:06.730
Sinbad! This is MY target!

18:06.730 --> 18:09.270
Hmph! That's decided on by <i>skill.</i>

18:09.270 --> 18:12.270
Nope! It's a matter of <i>brains!</i>

18:12.610 --> 18:13.940
Brains?

18:18.660 --> 18:20.450
A bomb? Duck!

18:25.330 --> 18:27.250
We can't see anything like this!

18:27.250 --> 18:30.210
I know where the hiding place is!

18:32.670 --> 18:36.630
W-What?! Damn it, I won't allow you to steal it!

18:36.630 --> 18:40.010
Don't move! It could be a trap!

18:40.010 --> 18:43.640
I don't care! This is my brooch!

18:49.640 --> 18:52.020
Now I don't have to look for it.

19:05.120 --> 19:07.160
Yes, yes. This way!

19:08.960 --> 19:10.500
Hiiiiiii !

19:41.780 --> 19:42.700
What...?

19:42.700 --> 19:45.080
You mustn't have this!

19:45.080 --> 19:47.120
Shut up! Give it back!

19:47.950 --> 19:49.750
Snap out of it!

19:56.340 --> 19:58.300
In the name of God...

19:59.170 --> 20:01.630
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:01.630 --> 20:03.550
I seal you here!

20:04.390 --> 20:06.010
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:25.740 --> 20:26.830
Are you all right?

20:26.830 --> 20:30.200
He's all right. He just fainted.

20:30.200 --> 20:32.910
I'm sorry. I couldn't get you the brooch.

20:32.910 --> 20:36.000
No, I should be the one apologizing.

20:36.000 --> 20:37.840
I'm sorry for lying.

20:37.840 --> 20:40.710
My real name is Aoki Kaori.

20:40.710 --> 20:43.380
This is my only son, Keiichi.

20:43.380 --> 20:46.010
What?! I thought he died?!

20:46.010 --> 20:48.760
It was the same as if he had died.

20:48.760 --> 20:53.520
Keiichi brought that brooch from overseas,

20:54.600 --> 20:58.190
but he became obsessed with its beauty,

20:58.190 --> 21:02.150
and he completely changed.

21:03.450 --> 21:07.910
Many people die in the pursuit of treasure.

21:08.530 --> 21:14.540
I wanted to get the brooch away from Keiichi, but he wouldn't listen.

21:14.540 --> 21:17.040
So, I decided to steal it from him.

21:17.040 --> 21:19.380
You were going to throw it away in the first place?

21:19.380 --> 21:22.630
My son is much more important.

21:24.590 --> 21:27.180
Huh? Mom, what are you doing here?

21:27.180 --> 21:31.140
Keiichi! You're all right! Thank God!

21:31.140 --> 21:33.430
I'm so glad.

21:36.390 --> 21:40.900
Geez, what I had to go through this time!

21:41.110 --> 21:44.280
Maron! Maron, we're going to be late for school!

21:44.280 --> 21:45.320
Again?

21:45.320 --> 21:49.450
Could it really be a man this time?

21:49.450 --> 21:50.780
Let's go through the porch!

21:50.780 --> 21:53.240
But that's trespassing...

21:53.240 --> 21:55.040
But I'm worried.

21:55.040 --> 21:56.540
- Why would you worry?

21:55.960 --> 21:58.630
- Uh... Well...

21:56.540 --> 21:58.630
- Why?

22:05.510 --> 22:11.350
For billions of years,

22:11.430 --> 22:20.900
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.070 --> 22:29.530
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.780 --> 22:35.830
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.450 --> 22:39.250
The huge mountains...

22:41.960 --> 22:48.880
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.380 --> 22:53.930
It took everything.

22:56.180 --> 23:02.150
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.230 --> 23:09.150
we watched the world ending...

23:09.360 --> 23:15.240
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.370 --> 23:25.000
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.760 --> 23:37.930
Maron, if my dad fails to catch Jeanne this time, he has to quit being a detective.

23:37.930 --> 23:42.350
What?! It's not your dad's fault. It's because Jeanne is too good.

23:42.350 --> 23:44.110
That's not helping at all...

23:44.110 --> 23:48.530
It's my dream to become a detective and to solve crimes together with my dad.

23:48.530 --> 23:52.160
It's going to be bad if he gets fired. Yes! Very bad!

23:52.160 --> 23:55.490
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Detective Family! The Last Gamble

23:55.490 --> 23:59.290
Jeanne, this time for sure!
